### ============================================================================
### File: docs/api-tests/06-purchase-orders.http
### Purpose: Manual and automated HTTP requests for Module 6 (Purchase Orders: UC-25 to UC-27)
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, Thunder Client, and IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@mygodown.com
@adminPassword = AdminPassword123!
@managerEmail = manager@mygodown.com
@managerPassword = ManagerPassword123!
@staffEmail = staff@mygodown.com
@staffPassword = StaffPassword123!

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Authenticate as Administrator
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store admin token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authenticate as Warehouse Manager
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

### Store manager token
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Authenticate as Staff
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "{{staffPassword}}"
}

### Store staff token
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ============================================================================
### UC-25: Create Purchase Order
### ============================================================================

### 4. Create Draft Purchase Order (Warehouse Manager - 201 Created)
# @name createDraftPO
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "notes": "Automated procurement run for Q4 replenishment",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 10, "unitCost": 15.50 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 5, "unitCost": 20.00 }
  ]
}

### Store created PO ID
@draftPoId = {{createDraftPO.response.body.data.id}}

### 5. Create Directly as Ordered (Administrator - 201 Created)
# @name createOrderedPO
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 2,
  "warehouseId": 2,
  "status": "ordered",
  "notes": "Urgent stock replenishment order",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 12, "unitCost": 14.00 }
  ]
}

### Store ordered PO ID
@orderedPoId = {{createOrderedPO.response.body.data.id}}

### 6. Validation Failure: Empty Line Items (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "items": []
}

### 7. Validation Failure: Non-positive Quantity (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 0 }
  ]
}

### 8. Validation Failure: Negative Unit Cost (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5, "unitCost": -10.00 }
  ]
}

### 9. Validation Failure: Unknown Supplier (404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 999999,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### 10. Authorization Failure: Staff Denied PO Creation (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### ============================================================================
### UC-26: View Purchase Orders
### ============================================================================

### 11. List Purchase Orders with Pagination (Manager - 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Filter Purchase Orders by Status (Manager - 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?status=ordered
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Filter Purchase Orders by Warehouse (Manager - 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Purchase Order Details by ID (Manager - 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{draftPoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Get Non-Existent Purchase Order (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. Authorization Failure: Staff Denied PO View (403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### UC-P08: Edit Draft Purchase Order
### ============================================================================

### 17. Edit Draft Purchase Order (Manager - 200 OK)
### Allows changing supplier, warehouse, notes, and items with duplicate merge & total recalculation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{draftPoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 2,
  "warehouseId": 2,
  "notes": "Updated Q4 replenishment order before ordering",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 8, "unitCost": 18.00 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2, "unitCost": 18.00 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 5, "unitCost": 14.00 }
  ]
}

### 18. Authorization Failure: Staff Denied Editing PO (403 Forbidden)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{draftPoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 2,
  "warehouseId": 2,
  "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### ============================================================================
### State Machine & Transitions
### ============================================================================


### 17. Transition Draft PO to Ordered (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{draftPoId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "ordered"
}

### 18. Illegal Transition: Ordered to Draft (409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{draftPoId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "ordered"
}

### 19. Cancel an Ordered Purchase Order (200 OK)
# @name createPoToCancel
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "status": "ordered",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

@cancelPoId = {{createPoToCancel.response.body.data.id}}

### Execute cancellation
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{cancelPoId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Illegal Transition: Cancelled PO to Ordered (409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{cancelPoId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "ordered"
}

### ============================================================================
### UC-27: Receive Purchase Order & Double-Receive Guard (CRITICAL)
### ============================================================================

### 21. Happy Path: Receive Ordered Purchase Order (200 OK)
### Increases warehouse stock and inserts immutable 'in' movement ledger record
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{orderedPoId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 22. DOUBLE-RECEIVE GUARD: Attempt to receive already-received PO (409 Conflict)
### MUST fail with 409 and MUST NOT increase stock again
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{orderedPoId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 23. Illegal Receive: Attempt to receive a cancelled PO (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{cancelPoId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 24. Illegal Cancel: Attempt to cancel an already received PO (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{orderedPoId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### Authentication & Role Boundaries
### ============================================================================

### 25. Unauthenticated Request Rejection (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 26. Staff Denied Receiving (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{orderedPoId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json
